{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53062","headline":"驻节太康 · 郎士元","name":"驻节太康","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"霜叶飞红过夏墟，金风吹鴈集荒渠。\n鞭挥清渭分流外，目送乌江远树余。\n五子歌声犹在耳，十旬猎迹已成畲。\n天时人因堪惆怅，闷对牙旗展簿书。\n（影印文渊阁《四库全书》本《河南通志》卷七四、民国廿二年刊刘盼遂纂《太康县志》卷六、《古今图书集成·职方典》卷三八八《开封府部》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郎士元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53062.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53062","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}